1
00:00:41,600 --> 00:00:42,400
Who's there?

2
00:00:47,630 --> 00:00:48,430
Stop!

3
00:00:50,800 --> 00:00:52,360
How dare you chase me alone?

4
00:00:52,600 --> 00:00:53,930
Since you saw me,

5
00:00:55,060 --> 00:00:56,830
I can't let you live.

6
00:00:57,560 --> 00:00:58,360
Ah!

7
00:00:59,560 --> 00:01:01,400
Oh no, I was too impulsive.

8
00:01:04,330 --> 00:01:05,700
Uncle taught me this.

9
00:01:09,060 --> 00:01:09,930
Spiritual power?

10
00:01:09,930 --> 00:01:11,060
Isn't she a mortal?

11
00:01:12,730 --> 00:01:13,660
It worked!

12
00:01:14,500 --> 00:01:15,560
But the problem is,

13
00:01:16,060 --> 00:01:17,590
I can't hold on much longer.

14
00:01:29,500 --> 00:01:31,830
He was also injured by my spiritual power.

15
00:01:40,200 --> 00:01:42,030
Uncle, listen to me.

16
00:01:46,759 --> 00:01:47,890
Don't say anything.

17
00:01:48,160 --> 00:01:49,420
Go back and rest first.

18
00:01:51,200 --> 00:01:52,060
Ye Qifeng,

19
00:01:52,060 --> 00:01:53,700
deal with that man yourself.

20
00:01:55,360 --> 00:01:56,160
Yes.

21
00:02:10,400 --> 00:02:11,230
Uncle,

22
00:02:12,430 --> 00:02:14,830
you saw me use spiritual power,
didn't you?

23
00:02:14,900 --> 00:02:17,260
Are you suspecting me too?

24
00:02:17,460 --> 00:02:19,100
But I really don't remember anything,

25
00:02:19,100 --> 00:02:21,430
and I have no intention of harming anyone.

26
00:02:22,260 --> 00:02:23,920
If you still don't believe me,

27
00:02:24,100 --> 00:02:25,200
it's okay.

28
00:02:27,200 --> 00:02:28,400
I believe you.

29
00:02:28,730 --> 00:02:29,530
I...

30
00:02:30,860 --> 00:02:32,200
Uncle, what did you say?

31
00:02:33,000 --> 00:02:33,900
I said,

32
00:02:33,900 --> 00:02:35,730
I believe you.

33
00:02:46,730 --> 00:02:47,530
Uncle.

34
00:02:48,200 --> 00:02:49,430
Who is this?

35
00:02:49,800 --> 00:02:51,800
You must be A'kong.

36
00:02:52,400 --> 00:02:54,660
I am the healer of Yan Sect.

37
00:02:54,900 --> 00:02:56,829
Everyone calls me Medical Maniac.

38
00:02:57,060 --> 00:02:59,260
Let me take a look at you.

39
00:03:01,100 --> 00:03:03,300
Then, sorry to trouble you.

40
00:03:22,460 --> 00:03:24,400
What did he see in my body?

41
00:03:24,860 --> 00:03:26,230
Is it good or bad?

42
00:03:27,030 --> 00:03:29,329
Could I really be a

43
00:03:29,329 --> 00:03:30,000
monster?

44
00:03:34,900 --> 00:03:37,960
Girl, there's nothing seriously wrong
with your body.

45
00:03:38,360 --> 00:03:39,160
It's just that

46
00:03:40,130 --> 00:03:42,730
there's a very special power inside you.

47
00:03:43,060 --> 00:03:44,500
It's extremely powerful,

48
00:03:44,500 --> 00:03:46,530
but it seems to be wrapped by something

49
00:03:46,530 --> 00:03:47,860
and cannot be released.

50
00:03:49,200 --> 00:03:52,030
Power? But I can't feel it at all.

51
00:03:52,300 --> 00:03:53,430
You lost your memory,

52
00:03:53,430 --> 00:03:54,030
right?

53
00:03:54,400 --> 00:03:56,230
This power seems to be sealed
along with your

54
00:03:56,230 --> 00:03:58,100
memory.

55
00:04:03,130 --> 00:04:05,400
Sect Leader, she is indeed not a mortal,

56
00:04:05,400 --> 00:04:07,400
but she is definitely not
an ordinary demon either.

57
00:04:07,400 --> 00:04:08,400
I have practiced medicine

58
00:04:08,400 --> 00:04:10,260
for thousands of years

59
00:04:10,300 --> 00:04:11,830
and have never seen her constitution.

60
00:04:11,830 --> 00:04:13,330
The power in her body

61
00:04:13,460 --> 00:04:14,900
carries an ancient aura.

62
00:04:15,260 --> 00:04:16,600
If released,

63
00:04:16,700 --> 00:04:19,260
I'm afraid the entire demon realm
will be shaken.

64
00:04:19,260 --> 00:04:21,589
But right now, she's like a sealed bottle.

65
00:04:21,829 --> 00:04:23,560
The bottle contains a tsunami,

66
00:04:23,600 --> 00:04:26,130
but the bottle itself
is incredibly fragile.

67
00:04:28,730 --> 00:04:30,200
What about her injuries?

68
00:04:31,330 --> 00:04:33,930
It's fine.
They are all superficial wounds.

69
00:04:34,400 --> 00:04:36,060
I'll prescribe some medicine.

70
00:04:36,060 --> 00:04:38,390
She'll be fine after resting for two days.

71
00:04:43,159 --> 00:04:45,620
Girl, come to
the Medicine Valley tomorrow.

72
00:04:45,800 --> 00:04:48,000
I'll prepare a special medicine for you.

73
00:04:48,000 --> 00:04:50,730
It might help relieve
your physical discomfort.

74
00:04:51,030 --> 00:04:52,159
Thank you, Grandpa.

75
00:05:07,700 --> 00:05:09,160
It's so comfortable here.

76
00:05:11,200 --> 00:05:11,800
Madam,

77
00:05:11,900 --> 00:05:13,500
Senior Medical Maniac is inside.

78
00:05:13,500 --> 00:05:15,030
I will wait for you outside.

79
00:05:16,560 --> 00:05:17,800
Don't call me Madam.

80
00:05:18,430 --> 00:05:19,830
Just call me A'kong.

81
00:05:34,500 --> 00:05:35,330
That's her.

82
00:05:35,960 --> 00:05:37,230
the mortal of unknown origin

83
00:05:37,230 --> 00:05:38,830
who seduced the Sect Leader.

84
00:05:39,930 --> 00:05:42,430
I've heard the Sect Leader
let her stay in his room.

85
00:05:42,430 --> 00:05:45,159
Even Commander Ye has started
calling her Madam.

86
00:05:45,200 --> 00:05:48,360
How can a piece of trash
without any spiritual power deserve this?
